flowchart TB
    subgraph DSH[DeepSeek Harness：已提交答案输出]
        DL[LLM 分片] --> DE[Session Event Log]
        DE -->|只选 assistant/message| DP[逐块选取非空 text / image]
        DP --> DC[agent_message_chunk]
        DE -.不导出.-> DX[assistant/chunk / reasoning / tools / plan]
        DR[核心 agents.resume] -.不等于.-> DA[ACP session/load：未实现]
    end
    subgraph OH[OpenHands CLI：事件展示 + 可选 token 输出]
        OE[Conversation Events] --> OP[EventSubscriber + SharedEventHandler]
        OP --> OC[ACP 正文 / 思考 / 工具 / plan 更新]
        OT[LLM token callbacks] --> OS[TokenBasedEventSubscriber]
        OS --> OC
        OR[ACP session/load] --> OL[读取 state.events → EventSubscriber 重放]
    end
